    "title": "Boil water advisory for part of Wamego - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago The City of Wamego has issued a boil water advisory for areas north of Highway 24. This advisory will affect Wamego Middle School on Thursday, April 9. School will remain in session on a normal schedule. Bottled water will be available for students at breakfast, lunch, and throughout the day.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
